code,code,core,types,ui: iterate on job lifecycle markers (clarity, hygiene)

- JobStartedFn no longer takes a `&str` command parameter that no caller
  ever used; spawn hooks now fire with only the new id.
- Inline comments trimmed from narrative/passage-style prose down to
  why-not rationale; several outright violating comments deleted.
- `JobRegistry::live_ids` returns HashSet<u64> directly, removing the
  intermediate Vec + recollect at call sites that always wanted set
  membership semantics.
- `kill_not_in` adopts `keep` as a local HashSet binding instead of the
  keep_set intermediate.
- `outstanding_job_ids` / `outstanding_job_ids_at` use Vec::retain
  instead of a fresh collect.
- UI reconciliation blocks: dropped narrative comment headers, replaced
  HashSet re-collection with direct use of live_ids() (now a HashSet),
  used format-captured names ({ids}) instead of format! args.
- clippy::match_same_arms allowed on agent_message_for_event with the
  rationale comment preserved; explicit None arm documents the design
  choice against the wildcard.

Behavior preserved; no API contract changes. Workspace tests + clippy
green.
